I left out the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/state-read@0.1.0`, so importing `http-client` is the same rejection as before. The fetch would also send each item's untrusted text to an external host, outside the declared authority. If the grant is extended, the graph definition needs to declare it first, and the node should then be regenerated against that grant.

